gromacs~release-2020~Ib41e012b9f56591c80046b44891dd77af5a2f938;d359c2f6979c9c64033c5d154b88d769ddbe5b15;src/gromacs/taskassignment/taskassignment.cpp;357;0;0;        gmx_fatal(FARGS,;I agree this change is an improvement. _ But when there in exception on rank 0 of a physical node and that rank is not a master-rank of a simulation, all master ranks pass through the multisim barrier and all other simulation pass through the simulation barrier (unless MPI manages to terminate all ranks before that). This is avoiding by adding an additional call to simulationBarrier() before the multisim barrier.
