gromacs~release-2020~Ib41e012b9f56591c80046b44891dd77af5a2f938;d359c2f6979c9c64033c5d154b88d769ddbe5b15;src/gromacs/taskassignment/taskassignment.cpp;357;0;0;        gmx_fatal(FARGS,;Berk is correct about the progression in the case he mentions, and his change means that the master rank of the relevant simulation waits at the barrier, so all other simulation masters wait for that, and all other simulation non-masters wait for them. So the descriptive error will likely reach the terminal. Good catch! _  _  _ (The second simulationBarrier is still useful, so that non-master ranks wait.)
