gromacs~release-2020~I57c8e8ce81fdb7aaf65de89feebb369d3f2f10eb;b10d0365a405e0f0529e8b9e149a76ff29540dca;src/gromacs/mdrun/runner.cpp;293;291;293;                            "NOTE: GMX_GPU_PME_PP_COMMS environment variable detected, but the ";In the first case we will get: _ "NOTE: GMX_GPU_PME_PP_COMMS environment variable detected, but the 'GPU PME-PP communications' feature was not enabled as PME on the GPU with FFT and gather on the CPU is not supported." Which is a bit hard to read. Suggest changing clarification to be similar to the PmeRunMode::Cpu case: _ "NOTE: GMX_GPU_PME_PP_COMMS environment variable detected, but the 'GPU PME-PP communications' feature was not enabled as PME FFT and gather are not offloaded to the GPU (PME is running in a mixed mode)."
