gromacs~master~Ia1880f5670714c497f683be10a9e72b505ca6c5a;ca5a5c82247a5754a1eebb25a0b842a3432cef2e;.clang-format;6;0;0;AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: false;I think keeping alignment is more important because I find alignment helps the eye. With any of the arbitrary conventions I only care that it is consistent not what it historically has been. So I wouldn't mind changing it. We could of course also keep "right" but with the alignment on the left. But that does look a bit odd. Or we need to wait until this is fixed or fix it ourselves.
