gromacs~master~Idaed4da41bf5b72435c47bab8aeb7130b36b03c7;38f66a5e9a3f1ff5e35e4c1065b7ad6369f1a6fc;src/gromacs/mdlib/sim_util.cpp;796;0;0;    domainWork.haveCpuLocalForces     = (domainWork.haveSpecialForces || domainWork.haveCpuListedForceWork || stepWork.useCpuPmeFReduction ||;Yes. You are completely right. I just blindly copied whatever was prepared in the code, since I need to recycle haveCpuLocalForces variable. @Szilard?
