gromacs~master~I0181ff67065c75f20cddc361f695df9bf888cd88;5c615e1548924e43dceb9f630620c217d45da6b3;src/gromacs/mdlib/forcerec.cpp;1582;1581;1582;        fr->pmePpCommGpu = new gmx::PmePpCommGpu(cr->mpi_comm_mysim,;No, that's another one. This one could't be unique_ptr because that means any translation unit that makes a t_forcerec needs to know how to make everything. And we don't want to include a bunch of headers in forcerec.h just for that. So t_forcerec needs to declare a constructor and destructor that's defined in a single translation unit. _  _ But i fixed it. Now you don't need several headers like dispersioncorrection.h in nbnxm/benchmark/* files just to make a t_forcerec.
